/*+
 *
 *	This file contains an extra piece of comment block which can be inserted
 *	at the beginning of a source file to cause the "wflman" utility to
 *	generate a document containing a description only of the private
 *	functions used by a module. This allows two sets of manuals to be
 *	generated - one aimed at users of the library and the other aimed at
 *	developers of the library.
 *
 *	See the "Wflman" manual for a description of what the following
 *	paragraph does.
 *
 *
 *	MAN translate paragraphs:
 *		Ignored function name	=	Routine name; Internal function name
 *		Function name		=	Ignored routine name
 *-
 */
